##  0.1   --- Border
### 0.1.1 ----- Armour bases
Show
BaseArmour >= 1
    SetBorderColor 255 0 0
    Continue
Show
BaseEvasion >= 1
    SetBorderColor 0 255 0
    Continue
Show
BaseEnergyShield >= 1
    SetBorderColor 0 0 255
    Continue
Show
BaseArmour >= 1
BaseEvasion >= 1
    SetBorderColor 255 255 0
    Continue
Show
BaseEvasion >= 1
BaseEnergyShield >= 1
    SetBorderColor 0 255 255
    Continue
Show
BaseEnergyShield >= 1
BaseArmour >= 1
    SetBorderColor 255 0 255
    Continue
### 0.1.? ----- Quality
Show
Quality >= 1
    SetBorderColor 255 255 255
    Continue
